#: ../../ml/bayesian_prediction.rst:2
msgid "ベイズ推定と確率的予測"
msgstr "Bayesian Inference and Probabilistic Prediction"

#: ../../ml/bayesian_prediction.rst:4
msgid "パラメータの事後分布を求め、予測に使う方法を学びます。次に、関数の値の同時分布を考え、ガウス過程による予測を導きます。"
msgstr ""
"We derive the posterior distribution of the parameters and learn how to "
"use it for prediction. We then consider the joint distribution of "
"function values and derive a Gaussian process prediction."

